id: BUILD-033
ilities: [modularity]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Conditional plugin with && inserts falsy value into array
category: build
severity: warning
engine: presence
target:
  extensions: .js .ts .mjs
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
  content_contains: plugins
patterns:
  - regex: &&\s*new\s+\w+Plugin
    message: "Conditional plugin with && — inserts false/undefined into plugins array when condition is falsy, causing build errors"
  - regex: &&\s*require\(
    message: "Conditional require with && — inserts false into array when condition is falsy"
fix: Use .filter(Boolean) on the plugins array, or use a ternary with null — condition ? new Plugin() : null.
